# This app is OFFLINE-FIRST and currently runs with NO backend.
#
# Local SQLite (expo-sqlite + Drizzle) is the source of truth. No Supabase project is
# provisioned, and none is required to build, test, or log a workout. That is a
# deliberate decision (2026-08-16), recorded in docs/product/roadmap-state.md.
#
# The previous values in this file pointed at Supabase project `lerhdwwihmiuyqmyxrrh`,
# which is an unrelated ASX stock-portfolio database — 749,600 price rows, holdings and
# theses, with RLS disabled on 51 tables. It contains no workout tables and never did.
# Pointing the app at it risked writing this app's data into someone else's schema.
#
# Leave these unset unless you have deliberately provisioned a workout project.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY belongs in Supabase Edge Function secrets, never in the app bundle
# and never in this file:
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key
#
# Note: src/lib/supabase.ts calls createClient() at module scope and supabase-js throws
# "supabaseUrl is required" on an empty string, so an unset URL currently crashes at
# import rather than degrading gracefully. Tracked in docs/product/cleanup-backlog.md.
